        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-39720\"><b>Laurey Paris Cabinet Pull in Matte Black</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe its unique, fancy design, the Matte Black Paris Cabinet Pull will be a show-stopper on many kitchen cabinets. It has a deep, Matte Black finish well suited to old world decor. The 3 Inch Paris Matte Black Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Paris Matte Black Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish:Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Package with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Paris\">Laurey Paris Cabinet Hardware Collection</a>.\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-393972066\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39720-SM.jpg?v=1704354542\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU Matte Black Paris Pull\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-paris-cabinet-pull-laurey-39766\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39766-SM.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU Oil Rubbed Bronze Paris Pull\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-39720\"><b>Matte Black</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-paris-cabinet-pull-laurey-39766\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
